%%BeginProlog
%
%  PostScript prolog for output from xcircuit
%  Version: 3.9
%
%  Electrical circuit (and otherwise general) drawing program
%
%  Written by Tim Edwards 8/5/93--4/12/16  (tim@opencircuitdesign.com)
